Package: askr
Type: Package
Title: Ask AI Models Directly from R
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("leadership-research", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: askr provides a simple and extensible way for researchers,
    data scientists, and analysts to interact with AI / Large Language Models (LLMs)
    directly from R. It supports both hosted models (for example Azure OpenAI /
    gpt-4o / gpt-5) and open-source models (for example Mistral, Llama, DeepSeek,
    Phi). The package exposes a high-level helper for generating responses,
    summarizing text, or extracting insights from documents, and a lower-level
    helper for structured control of requests. Model definitions (alias, engine,
    provider, enabled) are managed through a JSON registry that can be overridden
    at runtime without modifying package code.
